      "description": "A hooded figure in a long ankle-length cloth robe, leaning slightly forward and cradling a wide shallow iron bowl of fire at waist height in both hands. The arms come forward and close around the bowl so that arms, bowl and body form one closed loop. Deep pointed hood with the face sunk back into a dark recess inside it. The robe falls straight to the feet and hides the legs entirely; narrow shoulders, no armour, no belt kit, bare hands. The bowl has a hard thick rim and the fire sits down inside it, below the rim line.",
